ame_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但可能也有很多公司不希望看见应聘者的工作记录里注明了“无故缺勤”、“不服从上级命令”的条目……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_7/1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.jpg","choice":[]},"48":{"step":[[48,49,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我可以帮你介绍一些不那么挑剔的公司，但我想你应该不需要我的帮助。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_7/1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.jpg","choice":[]},"49":{"step":[[49,50,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["塞梅尔维斯将萨赫蛋糕递到狼群的面前。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_7/1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.jpg","choice":[]},"50":{"step":[[50,51,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["所以我只给你准备了这个。算我请你的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_7/1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.jpg","choice":[]},"51":{"step":[[51,52,""]],"type":1,"name":["狼群","","Pavia","","","","",""],"head_icon":"301501.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你说完了吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_7/1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.jpg","choice":[]},"52":{"step":[[52,53,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","","Semmelweis","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308801.png","audio":"610023107","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["嗯。再见。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_7/1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.jpg","choice":[]},"53":{"step":[[53,54,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["狼群吃下一口蛋糕，塞梅尔维斯看见他脸上掌管微笑的肌肉抖了抖。他的下颌肌肉持续碾磨着，咀嚼着蛋糕，随后逐渐失去控制。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_7/1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.jpg","choice":[]},"54":{"step":[[54,55,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["他向塞梅尔维斯怒目而视，似乎想对她说些什么，看口型像是某句意大利脏话，但他的嘴角已经不受控制地抽动。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_7/1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.jpg","choice":[]},"55":{"step":[[55,56,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["塞梅尔维斯迅速转身，迈步朝多瑙河的方向走去。经过一处拐角时，她将口袋里的健康检查报告撕成碎片丢进垃圾桶，露出微笑。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_7/1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_wu.jpg","choice":[]},"56":{"step":[[56,57,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["黑幕","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/heiping.jpg","choice":[]},"57":{"step":[[57,58,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“鱼缸脸”曾向塞梅尔维斯提起过她正在撰写一篇关于愉悦的研究文章。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/heiping.jpg","choice":[]},"58":{"step":[[58,59,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她说，如果以一个人血液中测量出的血清素浓度为基准点，会发现很少有外在因素能影响这个浓度。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/heiping.jpg","choice":[]},"59":{"step":[[59,60,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但倘若一个人曾与死亡进行过贴面礼，在那之后他的血清素浓度就会飙升到感觉到愉悦的最高点。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/heiping.jpg","choice":[]},"60":{"step":[[60,61,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["同时“鱼缸脸”也发现，有一个条目对一个人是否感觉愉悦也至关重要。正是它促使了塞梅尔维斯的第三种醒来。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/heiping.jpg","choice":[]},"61":{"step":[[61,62,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["此时它就握在她手中。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/heiping.jpg","choice":[]},"62":{"step":[[62,63,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["氛围图-狩猎愉快，队长","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/1_9/1_9_at_ys_saimeierweisi.jpg","choice":[]},"63":{"step":[[63,64,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["塞梅尔维斯走下列车，站在原地，鼻子吸入温暖的空气。她听见车门关闭，感觉身后的空气随着列车驶离而流动。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/1_9/1_9_at_ys_saimeierweisi.jpg","choice":[]},"64":{"step":[[64,65,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她把手伸进外套的口袋深处，拿出一块巧克力放入口中。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/1_9/1_9_at_ys_saimeierweisi.jpg","choice":[]},"65":{"step":[[65,66,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["巧克力在她的口中上下晃动、融化，她感觉自己的太阳穴神经产生了一种奇特又愉悦的震动，这种感觉扩散到全身，令她露出微笑。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/1_9/1_9_at_ys_saimeierweisi.jpg","choice":[]},"66":{"step":[[66,67,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["跑","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/1_9/1_9_at_ys_saimeierweisi.jpg","choice":[]},"67":{"step":[[67,68,""]],"type":1,"name":["埃米尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"624301.png","audio":"7208575","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["不好意思我又迟到了，队长，这里的交通状况实在是……地图上明明看起来不远，可是……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/1_9/1_9_at_ys_saimeierweisi.jpg","choice":[]},"68":{"step":[[68,69,""]],"type":1,"name":["塞梅尔维斯","